--   minPrice, marketValue  current snapshot (copper per unit), nil if not listed now
--   median7d               median of the hourly market values over the last 7 days
--   avgSale7d              average price of estimated sales over the last 7 days, nil without sales
--   soldPerDay             estimated units sold per day over the last 7 days
--   saleRate               estimated sold / (sold + expired) units, nil if nothing ended yet
--   offers, quantity       current number of auctions and total units (0 if not listed now)
--   reference              long-term price: blend of our 30-day median market value and a
--                          one-time TSM start value (60-day average, imported once)
--   ownShare               weight of our own data in reference, 0..1 (observed days / 14)
--   min14, avg14, max14    lowest / average / highest hourly cheapest offer, last 14 days;
