--                          as one more point (min/max) and is blended into the average
--   days14                 days of own data behind them (hours listed / 24)
--   yesterday              daily price of the previous UTC day (median of the hourly cheapest offers)
--   trend                  PPO: EMA 3 days / EMA 14 days - 1 of the daily prices
--   direction              1 rising (EMA 3 > 7 > 14), -1 falling (3 < 7 < 14), 0 sideways
--   demand                 demandDay / 10 (the old scale, for addons before 0.19)
--   demandDay              units bought per day, own count over 7 days (ahmetrics add_demand)
--   saturation             share bought up to 5 % above the cheapest offer, nil with too few
--   certain                units certainly bought per day (partial commodity purchases, lower bound)
--   Medians of the hourly cheapest offers per Berlin calendar day (0:00-23:59 Europe/Berlin):
--   medToday, medTodayHours  today so far, hours with an offer behind it
--   medYesterday           the whole previous day
--   med7, med7Days         today plus the 6 full days before, days with an offer behind it
--   Reference R (addon ns.Item ref, cloud price_ref) = medYesterday, else med7, else medToday.
